sequenceDiagram
    participant FS as Field Staff
    participant MOBILE as Mobile App
    participant GW as E4H API Gateway (Existing)
    participant AUTH as E4H Auth Service (Existing)
    participant FPS as Field Planner Service (NEW)
    participant AMS as Activity Management Service (NEW)
    participant HFR as Health Facility Registry (Existing)
    participant HRMS as eGov HRMS (Existing)
    participant EGOV_FS as eGov Filestore (Existing)
    participant WF as eGov Workflow v2 (Existing)
    participant DB as E4H PostgreSQL (Shared)
    participant UI as E4H Web UI (Extended)
    participant QC as QC SPOC
    participant SPOC as Activity SPOC
    
    Note over FS,SPOC: E4H Integrated Activity Report Workflow
    
    FS->>MOBILE: Open assigned facility (authenticated)
    MOBILE->>GW: GET /field-planner/v1/facility-activities/{id}
    Note over MOBILE,GW: Mobile app uses E4H authentication
    GW->>AUTH: Validate field staff JWT token
    AUTH-->>GW: Field staff authenticated
    
    GW->>FPS: Get facility activity details
    FPS->>DB: Query facility_activities table (new)
    DB-->>FPS: Return facility activity record
    
    FPS->>HFR: GET /facility/v1/{facilityId}
    Note over FPS,HFR: Get facility details from existing registry
    HFR->>DB: Query existing facility table
    DB-->>HFR: Facility details (name, location, type, etc.)
    HFR-->>FPS: Facility information
    
    FPS-->>GW: Complete facility activity data
    GW-->>MOBILE: Display facility information
    MOBILE-->>FS: Show facility details and activity form
    
    FS->>MOBILE: Start activity execution
    MOBILE->>MOBILE: Load activity form template from app
    Note over MOBILE: Form fields based on activity type (Installation, QC, etc.)
    
    FS->>FS: Perform field activity
    Note over FS: Take photos, measurements, complete checklist
    
    loop Data Collection
        FS->>MOBILE: Fill form fields
        FS->>MOBILE: Capture photos/documents
        MOBILE->>MOBILE: Store data locally (offline support)
        
        alt Internet Available
            MOBILE->>GW: POST /field-planner/v1/mobile/reports/{id}/progress
            GW->>AMS: Auto-save progress
            AMS->>DB: Update facility_activities progress
            DB-->>AMS: Progress saved
            AMS-->>GW: Return save confirmation
            GW-->>MOBILE: Show "Progress saved"
        else Offline Mode
            Note over MOBILE: Data stored locally for later sync
        end
    end
    
    FS->>MOBILE: Complete activity and submit report
    MOBILE->>MOBILE: Validate form completion
    
    alt Form Validation Errors
        MOBILE-->>FS: Show validation errors
        FS->>MOBILE: Fix errors and resubmit
    else Form Valid
        MOBILE->>GW: POST /field-planner/v1/mobile/reports/_upload (multipart)
        GW->>AMS: Process report submission
        
        AMS->>HRMS: GET /egov-hrms/employees/_search
        Note over AMS,HRMS: Validate field staff employee ID
        HRMS-->>AMS: Field staff validated
        
        AMS->>EGOV_FS: POST /filestore/v1/files (photos, documents)
        EGOV_FS->>EGOV_FS: Validate file types and sizes using eGov rules
        
        alt File Validation Errors
            EGOV_FS-->>AMS: Return file validation errors
            AMS-->>GW: Return validation errors
            GW-->>MOBILE: Show file errors
            MOBILE-->>FS: "Invalid file format or size"
        else Files Valid
            EGOV_FS->>EGOV_FS: Store files in eGov Filestore
            EGOV_FS-->>AMS: Return file UUIDs and URLs
            
            AMS->>DB: Begin transaction
            AMS->>DB: Create activity_reports record (new table)
            DB-->>AMS: Return report UUID
            
            AMS->>DB: Update facility_activities status to COMPLETED
            AMS->>DB: Set completed_at timestamp
            DB-->>AMS: Status updated
            
            AMS->>WF: POST /egov-wf-v2/process/_transition
            Note over AMS,WF: Initiate report review workflow
            WF->>DB: Create workflow instance
            DB-->>WF: Workflow created
            WF-->>AMS: Review workflow initiated
            
            AMS->>DB: Commit transaction
            DB-->>AMS: Report submitted successfully
            
            Note over AMS: Send notification via Kafka event
            AMS->>AMS: Publish ActivityReportEvent
            
            AMS-->>GW: Report submitted successfully
            GW-->>MOBILE: Return success response
            MOBILE-->>FS: Show "Report submitted for review"
        end
    end
    
    Note over FS,SPOC: Report Review Process (E4H Integration)
    
    Note over QC: QC SPOC receives notification via E4H notification system
    
    QC->>UI: Login to E4H Web UI
    UI->>GW: GET /user/oauth/me
    GW->>AUTH: Validate QC SPOC JWT token
    AUTH-->>GW: QC SPOC authenticated with review permissions
    GW-->>UI: Authenticated user with QC role
    UI-->>QC: Show E4H dashboard
    
    QC->>UI: Navigate to report review queue
    UI->>GW: GET /field-planner/v1/activity-reports/_search?status=SUBMITTED
    GW->>AMS: Get reports pending review
    AMS->>DB: Query activity_reports table for submitted reports
    DB-->>AMS: Return pending reports
    AMS-->>GW: Return report list with facility details
    GW-->>UI: Display review queue
    UI-->>QC: Show reports awaiting review
    
    QC->>UI: Click on specific report to review
    UI->>GW: GET /field-planner/v1/activity-reports/{id}
    GW->>AMS: Get detailed report
    
    AMS->>DB: Query activity_reports table (new)
    DB-->>AMS: Return report data with attachments
    
    AMS->>HFR: GET /facility/v1/{facilityId}
    Note over AMS,HFR: Get facility details from existing registry
    HFR-->>AMS: Facility information
    
    AMS->>HRMS: GET /egov-hrms/employees/_search
    Note over AMS,HRMS: Get field staff details who submitted report
    HRMS-->>AMS: Field staff information
    
    AMS->>EGOV_FS: GET /filestore/v1/files/{fileIds}
    Note over AMS,EGOV_FS: Get attachment URLs from eGov Filestore
    EGOV_FS-->>AMS: File download URLs
    
    AMS-->>GW: Return complete report with all details
    GW-->>UI: Display report review interface
    UI-->>QC: Show report details, photos, checklist from integrated data
    
    QC->>QC: Review submitted data and attachments
    Note over QC: Examine photos, verify data, check compliance
    
    alt QC Review Decision: Approve
        QC->>UI: Click "Approve" report
        UI->>GW: POST /field-planner/v1/activity-reports/{id}/approve
        Note over GW: Body: { "action": "APPROVE", "comments": "..." }
        GW->>AMS: Process approval
        
        AMS->>HRMS: GET /egov-hrms/employees/_search
        Note over AMS,HRMS: Validate QC SPOC has approval permissions
        HRMS-->>AMS: QC SPOC validated
        
        AMS->>DB: Begin transaction
        AMS->>DB: Update activity_reports status to APPROVED (new table)
        AMS->>DB: Set reviewed_by and reviewed_at
        AMS->>DB: Store review comments
        DB-->>AMS: Review recorded
        
        AMS->>DB: Update facility_activities status to APPROVED (new table)
        DB-->>AMS: Facility activity approved
        
        AMS->>WF: POST /egov-wf-v2/process/_transition
        Note over AMS,WF: Complete workflow with APPROVE action
        WF->>DB: Update workflow status to APPROVED
        DB-->>WF: Workflow completed
        WF-->>AMS: Workflow state updated
        
        AMS->>DB: Commit transaction
        DB-->>AMS: Approval processed
        
        Note over AMS: Publish Kafka event for notifications
        AMS->>AMS: Publish ReportApprovedEvent
        
        AMS-->>GW: Approval processed successfully
        GW-->>UI: Return success response
        UI-->>QC: Show "Report approved successfully"
        
    else QC Review Decision: Reject
        QC->>UI: Click "Reject" and provide detailed comments
        UI->>API: PUT /api/v1/activity-reports/{id}/review
        Note over API: Body: { "action": "REJECT", "comments": "Detailed feedback..." }
        API->>WS: Process rejection
        
        WS->>DB: Begin transaction
        WS->>DB: Update report status to REJECTED
        WS->>DB: Set reviewed_by, reviewed_at, and comments
        DB-->>WS: Rejection recorded
        
        WS->>DB: Update facility_activities status to IN_PROGRESS
        DB-->>WS: Facility activity reset for rework
        
        WS->>DB: Commit transaction
        DB-->>WS: Rejection processed
        
        WS->>AS: Log rejection audit
        AS->>DB: Store rejection audit
        DB-->>AS: Audit logged
        
        WS->>NS: Send rejection notification with feedback
        NS->>MOBILE: Send push notification with comments
        MOBILE-->>FS: Show "Report rejected" with feedback
        NS->>UI: Send notification to Activity SPOC
        UI-->>SPOC: Show "Report rejected" notification
        
        WS-->>API: Rejection processed successfully
        API-->>UI: Return success response
        UI-->>QC: Show "Report rejected, feedback sent"
        
    else QC Review Decision: Flag for Field QC
        QC->>UI: Click "Flag for Field QC"
        UI->>API: PUT /api/v1/activity-reports/{id}/review
        Note over API: Body: { "action": "FLAG_FOR_FIELD_QC", "comments": "Requires on-site verification" }
        API->>WS: Process Field QC flag
        
        WS->>DB: Begin transaction
        WS->>DB: Update report status to FLAGGED_FOR_FIELD_QC
        WS->>DB: Set review details and comments
        DB-->>WS: Flag recorded
        
        WS->>DB: Create new facility_activity for Field QC
        Note over WS: Creates Field QC activity for the same facility
        DB-->>WS: Field QC activity created
        
        WS->>DB: Commit transaction
        DB-->>WS: Field QC flag processed
        
        WS->>AS: Log Field QC flag audit
        AS->>DB: Store audit record
        DB-->>AS: Audit logged
        
        WS->>NS: Send Field QC assignment notification
        NS->>UI: Notify Field QC SPOC
        NS->>MOBILE: Notify original field staff
        MOBILE-->>FS: Show "Flagged for Field QC"
        
        WS-->>API: Field QC flag processed
        API-->>UI: Return success response
        UI-->>QC: Show "Flagged for Field QC successfully"
    end
    
    Note over FS,SPOC: Activity SPOC monitors progress via E4H Dashboard
    
    SPOC->>UI: Login to E4H UI and check activity progress dashboard
    UI->>GW: GET /field-planner/v1/activity-assignments/{id}/progress
    GW->>AMS: Get activity progress statistics
    
    AMS->>DB: Query activity_reports status counts (new table)
    DB-->>AMS: Return progress statistics
    
    AMS->>HFR: GET /facility/v1/_search
    Note over AMS,HFR: Get facility context for progress reporting
    HFR-->>AMS: Facility data for context
    
    AMS-->>GW: Return integrated progress data
    GW-->>UI: Display E4H progress dashboard
    UI-->>SPOC: Show progress (Submitted: X, Approved: Y, Rejected: Z, Field QC: W)
    
    Note over FS,SPOC: E4H Integrated report lifecycle complete
    Note over FS,SPOC: Uses existing E4H services with new Field Planner extensions
    Note over FS,SPOC: All data stored in shared E4H PostgreSQL database
    Note over FS,SPOC: Workflow managed via eGov Workflow v2 service
    Note over FS,SPOC: Files stored in eGov Filestore service
    Note over FS,SPOC: User management via eGov HRMS service 